                "title": "Union Knobset",
                "description": "Part of Omnia's Traditions Collection, the Union Knobset features a simple elegance that makes it alluring. Made out of solid brass, this Omnia 472 Traditional Union Door Knob will look great in any home and since it is available in 7 beautiful finishes, you'll be sure to find the right one to fit your tastes. Designed to be easy to install, it will cover most 2-1/8 inch pre-drill bore holes and is available in dummy, passage, or privacy functions.\r\n",
